[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2603065060","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101846#issuecomment-2603065060","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101846","id":2603065060,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bJ57k","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-20T18:46:43Z","updated_at":"2025-01-20T18:51:21Z","body":"I'm not sure I understand what problem this is trying to solve?\r\n\r\nThis macro only gains a very slight decrease in typing, while making the call non-standard.\r\nIn some places you are also altering the semantic meaning, and / or making the code harder to read / maintain.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2603065060/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2603074990","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101846#issuecomment-2603074990","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101846","id":2603074990,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bJ8Wu","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-20T18:54:02Z","updated_at":"2025-01-20T18:54:03Z","body":"Functional & stylistic uniformity was the intent. The semantic meaning change was deliberate, as that seems to be what the rendering macros are adopting. `ALLOCA` is only actually used by the `ALLOCA_ARRAY` macro originally, so I wanted to replicate that pattern.\r\n\r\n…Though, now that I type it out, I'm making a LOT of assumptions here. This warrants more discussion to clarify intent, so making this PR was jumping the gun. I'll revisit this in the future with a proposal/discussion instead.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2603074990/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/